  "project_description": "Domain Menu Links is an extension of the Domain (Domain Access) module. It adds a 'Domains' dropdown to the administration toolbar (via Admin Toolbar) listing every enabled domain entity as a menu link. Each link points at that domain's configured path and opens in a new tab, so an administrator can jump between the domains of a multisite while browsing. A single settings form controls the weight of the parent toolbar link, and a dedicated permission ('view toolbar domain menu') controls who sees the dropdown.",
